## Music

Interactive vinyl player.

Concept:

* Records fan outward from the left.
* Selecting a record moves it onto the player or replaces the artwork on the record already on the player.
* The Spear of Longinus spins on its own axis like a ballerina rather than acting as a spindle.
* Album choices are manually curated.

No Spotify integration is currently planned.

